codex
Co 2 cum can tranh false positive:
- `update_option()` trong `IntegrationsApiHandler` khong phai arbitrary option update, vi key co dinh va input `integration` bi rang buoc vao danh sach tich hop.
- Cac public submit route (`/contact`, `/optinmonster`, AJAX abandoned carts) chu yeu la public marketing intake, nen toi dang tach "abuse/spam by design" khoi finding bounty-worthy.

Toi se doc surface/candidate tom tat de dam bao khong bo sot anomaly quan trong truoc khi ket luan JSON.
