codex
Phase 2 report is written to [reports/phase2/hostinger-reach-phase2.codex.json](/Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase2/hostinger-reach-phase2.codex.json).

Result: `0 TP`, `1 REVIEW`, `4 FP`, plus `2 OOS`. The only remaining `REVIEW` is the public `POST /token` flow trusting `/.api_token` as alternate authorization material before storing `hostinger_reach_api_key`; I could trace that path to the sink, but I could not prove a remote way to obtain `/.api_token` from this repo alone. I also refuted the major Phase 1 false positives around arbitrary option update on `/integrations`, unknown-auth REST mutations, the abandoned-cart AJAX path, and the survey XSS signal.

Validation: `jq empty reports/phase2/hostinger-reach-phase2.codex.json` passed.
